    {
      "source": "Simple interface to ease streamability of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>s.",
